[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0010","text":"雾子小姐，谢谢你愿意陪我来！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0020","text":"我也一直想……来这边散散步……！\n超级开心的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0030","text":"呵呵……\n太好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0040","text":"！　有人在那里！\n你好——！在散步吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0050","text":"…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0060","text":"啊……\n好像是……指示牌……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0070","text":"真的……！\n诶嘿嘿，搞错了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0080","text":"上面写了些什么呢……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0090","text":"嗯…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0100","text":"啊，太阳……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0110","text":"雾子小姐雾子小姐！\n指示牌被照亮了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0120","text":"感觉像是在说“来读我吧”！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0130","text":"哇……真的呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0140","text":"呵呵……太阳公公……\n说不定听到了……我们的对话呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020800_03_0150","text":"……！　是的！"}]
